---
import StorefrontLayout from '../../layouts/Storefront.astro';
---

<StorefrontLayout 
  title="Returns & Refunds | Symeno"
  description="Our 30-day return window, condition requirements, and refund processing."
>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-base py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="mb-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-content md:text-5xl uppercase">
          Returns & Refunds.
        </h1>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-brand uppercase">
          Last Updated: May 13, 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-12 leading-relaxed font-light text-content-muted">
        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-4 border-b border-outline pb-2 text-xl font-bold text-content">
            1. The 30-Day Window
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            We accept returns on eligible products within exactly 30 days of the delivery date. To initiate a return, you must contact our operations team at <a href="mailto:returns@symeno.com" class="text-brand hover:underline">returns@symeno.com</a> to acquire a Return Merchandise Authorization (RMA) number.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-4 text-brand-alert font-bold">
            Unauthorized returns sent to our warehouse without an active RMA number will be rejected and returned to the sender at their expense.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-4 border-b border-outline pb-2 text-xl font-bold text-content">
            2. Shipping Liability & Costs
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            Unless the hardware received was mathematically defective out-of-the-box or we shipped the incorrect SKU, <strong class="text-content">the buyer is 100% responsible for all return shipping costs.</strong>
          </p>
          <ul class="mb-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
            <li>We highly recommend using a trackable shipping service and purchasing shipping insurance. We do not guarantee that we will receive your returned item.</li>
            <li>Original shipping costs paid at checkout are strictly non-refundable. If you receive a refund, the cost of original shipping will be deducted from your payout.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-4 border-b border-outline pb-2 text-xl font-bold text-content">
            3. Condition Requirements & Margins
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            Because we operate on compressed margins to offer you wholesale pricing, we must strictly enforce condition requirements upon inspection at our logistics center:
          </p>
          <ul class="mb-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
            <li>
              <strong class="font-medium text-content">Unopened / Factory Sealed:</strong> Eligible for a 100% full refund to the original payment method (minus original shipping).
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="font-medium text-content">Opened / Used (Undamaged):</strong> Subject to a strict <span class="font-mono font-bold text-brand">15% Restocking Fee</span>. We cannot legally or ethically sell opened electronics as new.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="font-medium text-content">Damaged / Missing Parts:</strong> Rejected entirely. Not eligible for a refund. The item will be shipped back to you at your expense.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-4 border-b border-outline pb-2 text-xl font-bold text-content">
            4. Refund Processing Pipeline
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            Once your return is received at our logistics center, it undergoes a mandatory 48-hour hardware inspection. Once cleared, the refund (minus any applicable restocking fees or shipping deductions) is immediately transmitted to our payment processor (Stripe).
          </p>
          <p class="mb-4">
            Depending on your financial institution's clearing cycles, funds will physically appear in your account within 5 to 10 business days.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</StorefrontLayout>